<!-- rtdf-document-id: sara/section1 -->

> Module Section1
> Using Definitions as W

```catala-metadata
declaration enumeration FilingStatus:
  -- JointOrSurviving
  -- HeadOfHousehold
  -- Unmarried
  -- MarriedFilingSeparately

declaration scope IncomeTax:
  input taxable_income content money
  input filing_status content FilingStatus
  output tax content money

declaration scope TotalTax:
  input taxable_income content money
  input filing_status content FilingStatus
  input unemployment_tax content money
  income_tax_scope scope IncomeTax
  output income_tax content money
  output total_tax content money
```

```catala
scope TotalTax:
  definition income_tax_scope.taxable_income equals taxable_income
  definition income_tax_scope.filing_status equals filing_status
  definition income_tax equals income_tax_scope.tax
  definition total_tax equals income_tax + unemployment_tax
```

§1. Tax imposed

(a) Married individuals filing joint returns and surviving spouses

There is hereby imposed on the taxable income of-


```catala
scope IncomeTax:
  definition tax equals
    round of
      (match filing_status with pattern
       -- FilingStatus.JointOrSurviving: joint_tax of taxable_income
       -- FilingStatus.HeadOfHousehold: head_tax of taxable_income
       -- FilingStatus.Unmarried: unmarried_tax of taxable_income
       -- FilingStatus.MarriedFilingSeparately: separate_tax of taxable_income)
```

    (1) every married individual (as defined in section 7703) who makes a single return jointly with his spouse, and


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0004; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(a)(1); source-lines: 7-7; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration joint_return_subject content boolean
  depends on married_under_section_7703 content boolean,
             made_joint_return content boolean
  equals married_under_section_7703 and made_joint_return
```

    (2) every surviving spouse (as defined in section 2(a)),


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0005; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(a)(2); source-lines: 9-9; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration surviving_spouse_subject content boolean
  depends on surviving_spouse_under_section_2 content boolean
  equals surviving_spouse_under_section_2
```

a tax determined in accordance with the following:


```catala
declaration joint_tax content money
  depends on income content money
  equals
    if income <= $36900 then joint_bracket_one of income
    else if income <= $89150 then joint_bracket_two of income
    else if income <= $140000 then joint_bracket_three of income
    else if income <= $250000 then joint_bracket_four of income
    else joint_bracket_five of income
```

    (i) 15% of taxable income if the taxable income is not over $36,900;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0007; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(a)(i); source-lines: 13-13; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration joint_bracket_one content money
  depends on income content money
  equals 15% * income
```

    (ii) $5,535, plus 28% of the excess over $36,900 if the taxable income is over $36,900 but not over $89,150;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0008; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(a)(ii); source-lines: 14-14; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration joint_bracket_two content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $5535 + 28% * (income - $36900)
```

    (iii) $20,165, plus 31% of the excess over $89,150 if the taxable income is over $89,150 but not over $140,000;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0009; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(a)(iii); source-lines: 15-15; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration joint_bracket_three content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $20165 + 31% * (income - $89150)
```

    (iv) $35,928.50, plus 36% of the excess over $140,000 if the taxable income is over $140,000 but not over $250,000;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0010; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(a)(iv); source-lines: 16-16; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration joint_bracket_four content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $35928.50 + 36% * (income - $140000)
```

    (v) $75,528.50, plus 39.6% of the excess over $250,000 if the taxable income is over $250,000.


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0011; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(a)(v); source-lines: 17-17; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration joint_bracket_five content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $75528.50 + 39.6% * (income - $250000)
```

(b) Heads of households

There is hereby imposed on the taxable income of every head of a household (as defined in section 2(b)) a tax determined in accordance with the following:


```catala
declaration head_tax content money
  depends on income content money
  equals
    if income <= $29600 then head_bracket_one of income
    else if income <= $76400 then head_bracket_two of income
    else if income <= $127500 then head_bracket_three of income
    else if income <= $250000 then head_bracket_four of income
    else head_bracket_five of income
```

    (i) 15% of taxable income if the taxable income is not over $29,600;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0013; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(b)(i); source-lines: 23-23; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration head_bracket_one content money
  depends on income content money
  equals 15% * income
```

    (ii) $4,440, plus 28% of the excess over $29,600 if the taxable income is over $29,600 but not over $76,400;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0014; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(b)(ii); source-lines: 24-24; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration head_bracket_two content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $4440 + 28% * (income - $29600)
```

    (iii) $17,544, plus 31% of the excess over $76,400 if the taxable income is over $76,400 but not over $127,500;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0015; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(b)(iii); source-lines: 25-25; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration head_bracket_three content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $17544 + 31% * (income - $76400)
```

    (iv) $33,385, plus 36% of the excess over $127,500 if the taxable income is over $127,500 but not over $250,000;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0016; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(b)(iv); source-lines: 26-26; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration head_bracket_four content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $33385 + 36% * (income - $127500)
```

    (v) $77,485, plus 39.6% of the excess over $250,000 if the taxable income is over $250,000.


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0017; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(b)(v); source-lines: 27-27; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration head_bracket_five content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $77485 + 39.6% * (income - $250000)
```

(c) Unmarried individuals (other than surviving spouses and heads of households)

There is hereby imposed on the taxable income of every individual (other than a surviving spouse as defined in section 2(a) or the head of a household as defined in section 2(b)) who is not a married individual (as defined in section 7703) a tax determined in accordance with the following:


```catala
declaration unmarried_tax content money
  depends on income content money
  equals
    if income <= $22100 then unmarried_bracket_one of income
    else if income <= $53500 then unmarried_bracket_two of income
    else if income <= $115000 then unmarried_bracket_three of income
    else if income <= $250000 then unmarried_bracket_four of income
    else unmarried_bracket_five of income
```

    (i) 15% of taxable income if the taxable income is not over $22,100;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0019; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(c)(i); source-lines: 33-33; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration unmarried_bracket_one content money
  depends on income content money
  equals 15% * income
```

    (ii) $3,315, plus 28% of the excess over $22,100 if the taxable income is over $22,100 but not over $53,500;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0020; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(c)(ii); source-lines: 34-34; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration unmarried_bracket_two content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $3315 + 28% * (income - $22100)
```

    (iii) $12,107, plus 31% of the excess over $53,500 if the taxable income is over $53,500 but not over $115,000;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0021; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(c)(iii); source-lines: 35-35; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration unmarried_bracket_three content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $12107 + 31% * (income - $53500)
```

    (iv) $31,172, plus 36% of the excess over $115,000 if the taxable income is over $115,000 but not over $250,000;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0022; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(c)(iv); source-lines: 36-36; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration unmarried_bracket_four content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $31172 + 36% * (income - $115000)
```

    (v) $79,772, plus 39.6% of the excess over $250,000 if the taxable income is over $250,000.


<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0023; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(c)(v); source-lines: 37-37; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration unmarried_bracket_five content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $79772 + 39.6% * (income - $250000)
```

(d) Married individuals filing separate returns

There is hereby imposed on the taxable income of every married individual (as defined in section 7703) who does not make a single return jointly with his spouse, a tax determined in accordance with the following:


```catala
declaration separate_tax content money
  depends on income content money
  equals
    if income <= $18450 then separate_bracket_one of income
    else if income <= $44575 then separate_bracket_two of income
    else if income <= $70000 then separate_bracket_three of income
    else if income <= $125000 then separate_bracket_four of income
    else separate_bracket_five of income
```

    (i) 15% of taxable income if the taxable income is not over $18,450;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0025; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(d)(i); source-lines: 43-43; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration separate_bracket_one content money
  depends on income content money
  equals 15% * income
```

    (ii) $2,767.50, plus 28% of the excess over $18,450 if the taxable income is over $18,450 but not over $44,575;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0026; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(d)(ii); source-lines: 44-44; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration separate_bracket_two content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $2767.50 + 28% * (income - $18450)
```

    (iii) $10,082.50, plus 31% of the excess over $44,575 if the taxable income is over $44,575 but not over $70,000;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0027; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(d)(iii); source-lines: 45-45; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration separate_bracket_three content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $10082.50 + 31% * (income - $44575)
```

    (iv) $17,964.25, plus 36% of the excess over $70,000 if the taxable income is over $70,000 but not over $125,000;

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0028; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(d)(iv); source-lines: 46-46; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration separate_bracket_four content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $17964.25 + 36% * (income - $70000)
```

    (v) $37,764.25, plus 39.6% of the excess over $125,000 if the taxable income is over $125,000

<!-- rtdf-block-id: sara/section1:b0029; role: provision; provision-id: sara/section1(d)(v); source-lines: 47-47; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
declaration separate_bracket_five content money
  depends on income content money
  equals $37764.25 + 39.6% * (income - $125000)
```
